TI  - [Endoscopic obstruction treatment].
PG  - 195-200
AB  - The Authors reported the last year personal experience of disobstruction 
      endoscopic therapy; they described therefore an examination of the several 
      techniques proposed from the international literature and in particular dwell 
      upon laser-therapy and airway stents implantation. They emphasized the treatment 
      importance, mostly palliative, but the effective symptomatology improvement due 
      to airway obstruction, bleeding, pain and secretions retenction. They emphasize 
      finally the necessity of a careful and scrupulous patients selection for 
      disobstruction endoscopic therapy.
